# VMS-41R1 preexecution freeze tests audit checklist

- [ ] Tests verify default freeze bytes equal the pinned historical deterministic payload.
- [ ] Tests verify existing freeze revalidation is append-once and does not authorize side effects.
- [ ] Tests verify temporary output can be created and later drift is rejected.
- [ ] Tests verify live/model/DB/Solver/Redis/network/subagent authorization remains zero.
- [ ] Tests verify the freeze script imports no model, Solver, DB, network or subprocess surface.
- [ ] The reconstructed payload matches the immutable historical freeze except for the documented platform field.
- [ ] Evolved current source files are not substituted for pinned frozen member bytes.
